      (∀ i, vs i ∈ M i ∧ Tc (vs i) = lam • vs i) ∧
      v = ∑ i, vs i := by p2m_exact_reverting @_root_.P2MW.S_AutomorphicForm_CuspidalSpectrum_exists_orthogonal_isIrreducibleCuspSubrep_sum_eq_of_apply_eq_smul.solution
